    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "🗺️ Data Source Lineage — Where does each number come from?",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 69 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "```\nSources (7 streams) ─────────────────────────────────────────\n  src_warehouse_master    → DIM_PRODUCT (product_id, unit_cost,\n                             reorder_threshold, max_capacity)\n  src_iot_rfid_stream     → Silver IoT → current_stock_on_shelf\n  src_inventory_txn (CDC) → FCT_INVENTORY (late_arriving flag)\n  src_sales_history       → FCT_SALES → units_sold_7d\n  src_weather_api         → weather_risk flag\n  src_manufacturing_logs  → defect signals (adhoc_002)\n  src_legacy_trends       → regional baseline (str_001)\n\nTransformation ──────────────────────────────────────────────\n  Silver Transformer  → cleans, partitions, adds late_arriving\n  Gold Aggregator     → FCT_REPLENISHMENT\n                         (urgency_score, suggested_order_qty,\n                          needs_replenishment, weather_risk)\n  dbt semantic layer  → fct_daily_revenue, fct_inventory_movements,\n                         dim_warehouse\n\nConsumption ─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  analytics-service   → exec_001 (KPI scorecard)\n                      → exec_002 (PKR spend, top-50 priorities)\n  /metrics/prometheus → Grafana panels (this dashboard)\n  /dashboard          → Top-10 bar chart, priority SKU table\n```"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 30,
