      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 77 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| KPI turns red | Data source | Immediate action |\n|---|---|---|\n| **% Catalog at Risk > 35%** | FCT_REPLENISHMENT ÷ DIM_PRODUCT count | Escalate to procurement — widespread understock |\n| **Critical SKUs > 500** | urgency_score ≥ 0.5 in FCT_REPLENISHMENT | Release purchase orders today for listed priorities |\n| **Order Spend > 200 M PKR** | suggested_order_qty × DIM_PRODUCT.unit_cost | Seek finance approval for replenishment budget |\n| **Late Deliveries > 15%** | FCT_INVENTORY CDC late_arriving flag | Call logistics team / escalate to suppliers |\n| **Warehouse Bottlenecks > 0** | DIM_WAREHOUSE high throughput + low shelf | Rebalance inbound stock between warehouse locations |\n| **Adjustment Rate > 10%** | DIM_WAREHOUSE.adjustment_rate_pct | Audit warehouse processes for shrinkage / mis-picks |\n| **Weather Disruption = ACTIVE** | FCT_REPLENISHMENT.weather_risk via src_weather_api | Add safety stock buffer; extend delivery promises |\n| **Peak Urgency > 70%** | max(urgency_score) in FCT_REPLENISHMENT | One SKU near imminent stockout — PO immediately |\n| **Sold > Order Qty (chart)** | FCT_SALES.units_sold_7d vs suggested_order_qty | Under-ordering — increase order quantities |\n\n**Full detail:** [📊 Top-10 bar chart, priority SKU table, monthly revenue trend →](http://localhost:8002/dashboard) — refreshes every 30 s."
